[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0331","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0331.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49977","title":"AmauriC tarteaucitron.js Cookie 任意删除漏洞","description":"tarteaucitron.js 是一款合规的 Cookie 横幅管理工具，其 `tarteaucitron.cookie.purge()` 方法在调用时未校验触发元素是否为合法的 tarteaucitron 按钮，也未校验待删除的 Cookie 是否属于该工具管理的服务。攻击者若能在页面中注入 HTML，可通过构造带有 `purgeBtn` 类名和 `data-cookie` 属性的元素，诱骗用户点击后静默删除任意非 HttpOnly 的已知名称 Cookie。该漏洞影响 1.33.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。建议升级至 1.33.0 或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49977","GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:06.930","updated":"2026-07-20T19:17:24.153","remediation":"立即将 tarteaucitron.js 升级至 v1.33.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 purgeBtn 类元素的 data-cookie 属性进行合法性校验。如无法立即升级，可在服务端设置 Content-Security-Policy 限制 HTML 注入，并对所有敏感 Cookie 启用 HttpOnly 标志以防止被删除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/commit/24b5464400ae2ff1ad96a092c629b9d632b9cc93","https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/releases/tag/v1.33.0","https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/security/advisories/GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7","https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49977.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49977.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/tarteaucitronjs/CVE-2026-49977.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49977.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-49977.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/26a5e326ef676363d5474a63ced6954307af1dac/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-49977-2026-06-03-1705","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7/GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49977.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2026-49977-2026-06-03-1705","https://github.com/Huangu0/sec_rss_news/blob/39135d30f22c26acca3e969387228d89b339f0d6/output/daily/2026-07-18.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0331.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0331.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0271","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44891","title":"Netty StompSubframeDecoder 未限制请求头数量拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netty 框架中的 STOMP 协议解码器 StompSubframeDecoder 存在未限制请求头数量和大小的漏洞。maxLineLength 参数仅限制单行头部长度，但未对单个 STOMP 帧中的总头部数量或累积大小进行限制。远程攻击者可发送大量短头部数据，导致服务端内存无限增长直至 JVM 抛出 OutOfMemoryError，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Netty 4.1.136.Final 之前及 4.2.16.Final 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44891","GHSA-vhch-2wf3-m8rp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:06.250","updated":"2026-07-21T20:25:45.920","remediation":"升级 Netty 至 4.1.136.Final 或 4.2.16.Final 及以上版本，这两个版本已对 STOMP 帧的头部总数和累积大小施加限制。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 STOMP 连接设置最大头部数量阈值，或通过反向代理限制单连接请求体大小作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/5b68c61f37aa4a3045cba624cbea239655c9003b","https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/bb2ff68a1fb71cb4b0eb9a9e17b66c52aff680c6","https://github.com/netty/netty/pull/17063","https://github.com/netty/netty/pull/17065","https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.1.136.Final","https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.2.16.Final","https://github.com/netty/netty/security/advisories/GHSA-vhch-2wf3-m8rp","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-44891.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44891.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-44891.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/acd6946b811240fd9eb8b4695a0847eda8db127d/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-44891","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44891.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/io.netty/netty-codec-stomp/CVE-2026-44891.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44891.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/57037e9ca1e585082424bbd15c12a674807d0c21/content/posts/cve-2026-44891.md","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/8a18f344792f20d1c2a7515315a80b5fa6191d7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d35b9b2c96d01b1b2393c4443fe48dfd8e9687ce/cve/CVE-2026-44891.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0271.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0352","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50289","title":"systeminformation systeminformation OS 命令注入漏洞","description":"systeminformation 库的 networkInterfaces() 函数在 Linux 上存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。漏洞根因在于 lib/network.js 的 checkLinuxDCHPInterfaces() 函数在解析 Debian/Ubuntu interfaces(5) 配置文件时，读取 /etc/network/interfaces 及其递归 source 指令引用的文件，将解析出的 source 路径直接未加引号地插入到 shell 命令字符串 `cat ${file} 2> /dev/null | grep 'iface\\\\|source'` 中，并通过 execSync() 经 /bin/sh 执行。攻击者若能控制 source 指令中的路径字符串（如写入包含 `;id>/tmp/PWNED;` 等 shell 元字符的路径），即可在调用 networkInterfaces() 的 Node.js 进程权限下执行任意命令。该函数被 networkInterfaces()、getStaticData()、getAllData() 等核心 API 间接调用，影响 systeminformation@5.31.7 之前版本，波及使用该库的资产清点、监控诊断、管理面板后端、设备管理代理等大量 Node.js 应用。攻击前置条件为攻击者能写入或影响被 source 递归引用的 interfaces 配置片段文件（如 /etc/network/interfaces.d/ 下的文件），无需 NetworkManager 或特殊硬件。利用方式为构造恶意 source 路径触发命令注入，PoC 验证显示可成功执行 id 命令并写入标记文件。CVSS 4.0 评分 8.7（HIGH），已在 5.31.7 版本修复，建议升级至该版本或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50289","GHSA-5xpp-75jx-m839"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:24.857","updated":"2026-07-20T17:17:14.860","remediation":"建议立即升级 systeminformation 包到 5.31.7 或更高版本（npm install systeminformation@latest）。升级后该库将使用 fs.readFileSync 直接读取 /etc/network/interfaces 文件内容并通过 JS 逻辑解析，彻底移除 execSync 拼接 shell 命令的方式，从而彻底修复 OS 命令注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时在应用层避免在 Linux 环境下调用 networkInterfaces()、getStaticData()、getAllData() 等会触及 networkInterfaces() 的 API，或在应用启动前确保 /etc/network/interfaces 及其 source 引用的文件不可被低权限用户写入（如 chmod 644 并限制写入权限）作为临时缓解。建议优先升级至 5.31.7+ 版本彻底修复。建议执行：npm audit fix --force 或 npm install systeminformation@5.31.7 完成升级。升级后建议运行现有测试用例验证网络接口信息采集功能正常。升级前建议备份 node_modules 并做回滚预案。升级后请重启所有依赖 systeminformation 的 Node.js 进程使新版本生效。如使用 Docker 部署，请重新构建镜像并拉取最新依赖。请参考官方修复提交：https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/commit/bbfddde48672d0ee124fefdb3cb4442fd9dd4f03","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/commit/bbfddde48672d0ee124fefdb3cb4442fd9dd4f03","https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/releases/tag/v5.31.7","https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/security/advisories/GHSA-5xpp-75jx-m839","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50289.json","https://github.com/giselles-ai/giselle/blob/4b497a5d3aff88100301329938f2f97db1b4a234/.continuity/20260717-000000-agent__fix-systeminformation-cve-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50289","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/systeminformation/CVE-2026-50289.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50289.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c6a7b446809d20910acd284474596c0b638aab06/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-50289/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9d5a7d1c566e3b3d2231325259c035dd0347ef0d/posts/cve-2026-50289-npm-systeminformation.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0344","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0344.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50197","title":"Zalando Skipper OpenPolicyAgent请求体检查绕过漏洞","description":"Zalando Skipper 的 OpenPolicyAgent 集成存在请求体绕过漏洞。当使用 opaAuthorizeRequestWithBody 过滤器时，HTTP/1.1 的 Transfer-Encoding: chunked 编码请求或 HTTP/2 中省略 content-length 伪标头的请求，会导致 ExtractHttpBodyOptionally 函数因 ContentLength 为 -1 而生成空的 raw_body，OPA 策略因此评估到空文档而放行请求，但上游服务却接收到完整的攻击载荷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞绕过基于请求体内容的授权策略（如字段黑名单、内容审核标记等），将恶意载荷透传至后端服务。该漏洞影响 Skipper ≤v0.26.8 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。官方已在 v0.26.10 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50197","GHSA-659f-rgp5-w4wf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:24.087","updated":"2026-07-20T16:17:04.550","remediation":"立即将 zalando/skipper 升级至 v0.26.10 或更高版本（commit 3152f3b0bb52ca89c3564be42434db0a2a1cea23）。如无法立即升级，须在 OPA Rego 策略中额外检查 `input.attributes.request.http.truncated_body` 字段，当该字段为 true 时拒绝请求，防止超长或分块请求体绕过 body 内容检查。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/zalando/skipper/commit/3152f3b0bb52ca89c3564be42434db0a2a1cea23","https://github.com/zalando/skipper/pull/4041","https://github.com/zalando/skipper/releases/tag/v0.26.10","https://github.com/zalando/skipper/security/advisories/GHSA-659f-rgp5-w4wf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50197.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50197.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50197.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/zalando/skipper/CVE-2026-50197.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50197.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50197.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5944.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8qqm-fp2q-v734/GHSA-8qqm-fp2q-v734.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/93d5167c4976c9015270e856ca23ec6140d458aa/cve/CVE-2026-50197.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50197.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0344.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0344.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0344.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0323","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49834","title":"Sigstore sigstore-go 多日志阈值绕过漏洞","description":"sigstore-go 是 Sigstore 项目用于签名和验证的 Go 语言库。其多日志阈值验证机制存在逻辑缺陷：当配置使用 N>1 个透明日志或 N>1 个签名证书时间戳时，阈值计数按每个条目或每条验证路径的见证者数量计算，而非按日志权威机构计算。这导致单个被攻破的透明日志可通过构造不同索引的多个条目，或单个被攻破的证书时间戳日志通过多次验证（跨多个证书链或嵌入多个 SCT），完全满足多日志阈值要求，从而绕过多日志安全策略。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，但攻击复杂度较高。该漏洞影响 sigstore-go 1.2.0 之前的所有版本，仅破坏签名验证的完整性，不影响机密性和可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49834","GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:21.963","updated":"2026-07-21T20:25:45.920","remediation":"将 sigstore-go 库升级至 v1.2.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了多日志阈值绕过问题。如使用 Cosign，确认其阈值设置为 1 可不受影响。由于无临时缓解措施，必须完成版本升级才能消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/commit/dbb07e62623edd5b175fb9dd5a41dcb85a159207","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/pull/633","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/releases/tag/v1.2.0","https://github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/security/advisories/GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49834.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49834.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49834","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49834.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/sigstore/sigstore-go/CVE-2026-49834.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-49834.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-49834.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/61f6b2d4b98e3e29e30dc34c4c2a4eb43c8f5a51/data/reports/GO-2026-5952.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6/GHSA-9vcr-p3rj-q5q6.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-49834.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0323.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0348","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50273","title":"DataDog dd-trace-dotnet W3C baggage 头部解析不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Datadog .NET Tracer 在实现 W3C Baggage 传播协议时，解析传入的 Baggage HTTP 头部未对提取路径实施条目数量（DD_TRACE_BAGGAGE_MAX_ITEMS，默认 64）或字节大小（DD_TRACE_BAGGAGE_MAX_BYTES，默认 8192）限制。远程未认证攻击者可构造包含大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 Baggage 头部发送至目标服务，导致追踪器为每个请求分配大量哈希表条目，引发无限制的 CPU 和内存消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响启用了 Baggage 传播样式（默认启用）的所有互联网暴露的 .NET 应用服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Datadog 已在 dd-trace-dotnet 3.43.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50273","GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T18:17:16.840","updated":"2026-07-17T20:17:24.220","remediation":"立即升级 dd-trace-dotnet 至 3.43.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE（或 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE_EXTRACT）中移除 baggage 以禁用 baggage 提取；同时在上游代理或 Web 服务器（如 Nginx large_client_header_buffers、Apache LimitRequestFieldSize）限制 HTTP 请求头最大大小。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/commit/38092e0d41a36decbe649e048e48ae1b1607292f","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8555","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.43.0","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/security/advisories/GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50273.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50273.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/nuget/Datadog.Trace/CVE-2026-50273.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50273.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50273.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/927c9425d8f7f6609247b04933b3bb339d0de5f8/cve/CVE-2026-50273.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4/GHSA-38wr-vpc7-2mp4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50273.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/a6bf5ac7a2ca0e41f63a084ce77e4e18a9b97446/CVEs_log/2026-07-18_zh.md","https://github.com/danielfebrero/Fresh0day-PoCs/blob/ed049b0f8549b25b92b26174db3899b34db0b04f/CVE-2026-50272/docs/AFFECTED.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0348.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0348.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0229","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0229.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-63093","title":"Anysphere Cursor IDE Windows 版二进制植入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cursor for Windows 在启动及运行过程中会自动从工作区目录解析并执行 git.exe。攻击者可在仓库根目录放置恶意的 git.exe 文件，当开发者使用 Cursor 打开该仓库时，IDE 会在无任何用户交互和提示的情况下自动执行该恶意二进制文件，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞利用了不受信任的搜索路径（CWE-426），攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可获取当前用户权限下的完整控制权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-059c63e1","CVE-2026-63093"],"sources":["hwpoc","cve"],"published":"2026-07-17","updated":"2026-07-17","remediation":"Cursor 官方尚未发布修复版本。建议在受管 Windows 系统上通过 AppLocker 或 Windows 应用程序控制策略，禁止从工作区目录（如 %USERPROFILE%\\source\\repos\\）执行 git.exe；个人用户应在隔离环境（如 VM、Windows Sandbox）中打开不受信任的仓库。同时持续关注 Cursor 官方更新，在补丁发布后立即升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cursor-for-windows-rce-via-malicious-git-exe-in-workspace","https://mindgard.ai/blog/cursor-0day-when-full-disclosure-becomes-the-only-protection-left","https://nvd.nist.gov/view/vuln/detail?vulnId=CVE-2026-63093"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0229.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0416","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0416.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53598","title":"微软 Prompty 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Prompty 加载器在解析 .prompty 文件前沿的 ${file:...} 引用时，未强制限制解析路径在授权目录内，导致路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可构造包含 ${file:../../../etc/passwd} 或 ${file:/etc/passwd} 等恶意路径的提示文件，诱导应用加载不可信的 .prompty 文件，触发任意文件读取，泄露进程可访问的本地敏感文件。影响 PyPI prompty ≤2.0.0b1、npm @prompty/core ≤2.0.0-beta.1、crates.io prompty ≤2.0.0-beta.1、NuGet Prompty.Core ≤2.0.0-beta.1，修复版本分别为 2.0.0b2/2.0.0-beta.2。CVSS 7.5 HIGH，网络攻击向量，低复杂度，无需权限与用户交互，高机密性影响。修复版本默认限制文件引用仅能解析在提示文件目录树内，绝对路径、.. 遍历、符号链接逃逸均被拒绝。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53598","GHSA-wxhm-2mq7-7697"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-16T16:19:12.990","updated":"2026-07-17T14:17:24.793","remediation":"升级 PyPI prompty 到 2.0.0b2 或更高版本，升级 npm @prompty/core 到 2.0.0-beta.2 或更高版本，升级 crates.io prompty 到 2.0.0-beta.2 或更高版本，升级 NuGet Prompty.Core 到 2.0.0-beta.2 或更高版本。升级后验证文件参考扩展已应用 canonicalization 验证，防止路径遍历。此外，请检查当前 .prompty 配置文件是否限制了 allowed_roots，确定合理的根目录，限制 ${file:...} 引用范围。请优先升级到修正版本，对无法立即升级的系统，请先进行网络层访问控制，将 .prompty 文件解析权限定为可信目录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/commit/88ac9948d7d37995edbb2f6d36913436626c39e1","https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/security/advisories/GHSA-wxhm-2mq7-7697","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53598.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/82c2e2276363b4ef8fca1f40cb47533ebb3183e6/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-53598.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/pypi/prompty/CVE-2026-53598.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/992818ccbdd9f6977091594f07ba513fd996f055/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53598.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/a4d37ff32478ff1702cf9dfb37bf711c928ea219/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53598/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b2967c74374787d2c3ce14ea33111cd90ca3f359/content/posts/cve-2026-53598.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/22a460a6c302ae8487ab1964eb8c468bc315b979/cve/CVE-2026-53598.html","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/d76d29c73bae88b83713f8105a8ca21aef8b83c6/vulns/prompty/PYSEC-2026-3538.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2026-53598.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/c595459a296be97605ba77690d4f3d74a9d6334c/data/osv-cargo.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0416.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0416.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0416.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0415","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53597","title":"Microsoft Prompty 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Prompty TypeScript 加载器在解析 .prompty 文件前置内容时，直接调用 gray-matter 库且未禁用 JavaScript 前置内容引擎，导致攻击者可构造包含 ---js 可执行前置内容的恶意 .prompty 文件。受影响版本为 @prompty/core v2 预发布版本（>=2.0.0-alpha.1 <2.0.0-beta.3），攻击者诱导受害应用加载恶意提示词文件即可在 Node.js 宿主进程中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，影响加载不可信提示词文件、用户提供提示词路径或来自低信任源提示词包的应用。攻击条件为网络可达、低攻击复杂度、无需权限但需用户交互（诱导加载恶意文件），CVSS 4.0 评分 8.7（HIGH）。升级至 @prompty/core@2.0.0-beta.3 或更高版本可修复，修复显式禁用 js/javascript 前置内容引擎并拒绝执行。修复提交：c27402da2487075be577f06aa79df627fb9d6853。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53597","GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-16T16:19:12.860","updated":"2026-07-18T03:16:36.890","remediation":"立即升级 @prompty/core 至 2.0.0-beta.3 或更高版本（npm install @prompty/core@2.0.0-beta.3）。修复版本已显式禁用 gray-matter 的 js/javascript 前置代码引擎，拒绝执行 ---js 前置内容。暂无法升级时，请勿加载不可信的 .prompty 文件，并限制用户提示路径仅限可信目录。补丁提交：c27402da2487075be577f06aa79df627fb9d6853，已包含拒绝 ---js 前置内容的回归测试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/commit/c27402da2487075be577f06aa79df627fb9d6853","https://github.com/microsoft/prompty/security/advisories/GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53597.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/82c2e2276363b4ef8fca1f40cb47533ebb3183e6/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-53597.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/992818ccbdd9f6977091594f07ba513fd996f055/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53597.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/@prompty/core/CVE-2026-53597.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/a4d37ff32478ff1702cf9dfb37bf711c928ea219/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53597/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b2967c74374787d2c3ce14ea33111cd90ca3f359/content/posts/cve-2026-53597.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/22a460a6c302ae8487ab1964eb8c468bc315b979/cve/CVE-2026-53597.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw/GHSA-c4gh-rv8h-q9vw.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53597.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/686f05e66750f5d480775bfed77c62e546d41596/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-19_10-39-34.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0394","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52870","title":"MCP Python SDK 实验性任务功能未授权访问与权限绕过漏洞","description":"MCP Python SDK 实验性任务处理器存在授权缺失漏洞（CWE-862），受影响版本 1.23.0 至 1.27.1。漏洞原理：实验性任务功能启用后，默认处理器（tasks/list、tasks/get、tasks/result、tasks/cancel）仅基于任务标识符操作，未记录创建任务的会话，导致任务隔离失效。影响范围：调用 server.experimental.enable_tasks() 且服务多客户端的 MCP 服务器，CVSS 7.6（HIGH）。攻击条件：攻击者需作为已连接客户端，服务器需启用实验性任务功能且服务多客户端。利用方式：攻击者通过 tasks/list 枚举所有任务，通过 tasks/get 和 tasks/result 读取任意任务状态与结果，消费本应发送给任务创建者的引导消息（如 elicitation 请求），并通过 tasks/cancel 取消他人任务。修复：升级至 1.27.2 或更高版本，或禁用实验性任务功能，或自行实现会话归属校验的任务处理器。修复版本中任务 ID 嵌入不透明会话标记，默认处理器限制会话仅访问自身任务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52870","GHSA-hvrp-rf83-w775"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T20:17:38.577","updated":"2026-07-17T18:07:07.873","remediation":"立即升级 MCP Python SDK 至 1.27.2 或更高版本（pip install -U mcp），修复版本会在任务 ID 中嵌入会话标记并限制会话仅访问自身任务。若无法立即升级，请移除代码中 server.experimental.enable_tasks() 调用以禁用实验性任务功能，或自行实现带会话归属校验的自定义任务处理器作为临时缓解措施。建议同时检查依赖该 SDK 的所有 MCP 服务端部署并同步升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/62137874ff26dd74d2fea80ff528a7fd9ca7a5e7","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2720","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/releases/tag/v1.27.2","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-hvrp-rf83-w775","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52870.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-52870.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/f792732d95fcd5791350336c3993c8569599affe/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-52870.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/3a636e9ca4dec610ea52bddffa3cd59a180b7252/pypi/mcp/CVE-2026-52870.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_3_CVE-2026-52870.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a257431e220101b25f51c7e22239ee65d73c4dbf/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52870.json","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/8a18f344792f20d1c2a7515315a80b5fa6191d7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/f15100526750b2cf9bd4dc0cc587f58f968afb29/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-52870/README.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9ab526ab0d836fa102f77f626060e2b9458bc808/cve/CVE-2026-52870.html","https://github.com/aws-solutions/generative-ai-application-builder-on-aws/blob/483ace2fb897a5a862c7d51cb6dd41064220d18f/CHANGELOG.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0393","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0393.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-52869","title":"Model Context Protocol Python SDK HTTP 传输会话认证绕过漏洞","description":"MCP Python SDK (PyPI 包名 mcp) 在 1.27.2 版本前存在会话认证绕过漏洞。其 SSE 传输 (mcp.server.sse.SseServerTransport) 和有状态 Streamable HTTP 传输 (mcp.server.streamable_http_manager.StreamableHTTPSessionManager) 在路由请求到现有会话时，仅依据会话标识符 (SSE 使用 session_id 查询参数，Streamable HTTP 使用 Mcp-Session-Id 头) 进行查找，未验证请求的认证主体是否与创建会话时的主体一致。导致任意获取或猜测到会话 ID 的攻击者，可使用不同的 Bearer Token 向该会话注入 JSON-RPC 消息，绕过基于 Bearer Token 的客户端隔离机制。SSE 传输会将响应返回给原客户端的事件流，Streamable HTTP 则直接在注入请求中返回结果，攻击者可读取执行结果。影响范围：使用 SSE 或有状态 Streamable HTTP 传输且启用了 SDK 内置 Bearer Token 认证的服务器（stdio 传输、无状态 Streamable HTTP、未启用认证的服务器不受影响）。攻击条件：攻击者需通过日志泄露、网络监听等途径获取合法会话 ID（随机 UUID，需窃取）。利用方式：攻击者携带窃取的会话 ID 发送携带恶意 JSON-RPC 消息的 HTTP 请求，劫持目标会话执行任意操作。CVSS 3.1 评分 7.1 (HIGH)，向量 CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:L，CWE-639。官方已在 1.27.2 版本修复，修复版本会记录创建会话时的认证主体（OAuth client_id 及 token 的 issuer/subject），拒绝不同主体的请求。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-52869","GHSA-jpw9-pfvf-9f58"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T20:17:38.427","updated":"2026-07-17T18:06:50.957","remediation":"立即升级 MCP Python SDK 到 1.27.2 或更高版本，该版本记录了创建会话时的认证主体信息（OAuth 客户端 ID + 令牌的颁发者和主题），并通过 404 响应拒绝不同主体的认证请求。确保自定义认证后端或其他令牌验证器实现类似比对逻辑，如：从令牌的 sub 声明中提取 subject 字段，实现细粒度的用户级会话隔离。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/1abcca2408a6b50e10ec601181f63f9978705c00","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/commit/ce267b6fc515dc4efc1dc70b6975b16ff0feef0a","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2690","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/pull/2719","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/releases/tag/v1.27.2","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-jpw9-pfvf-9f58","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52869.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/f792732d95fcd5791350336c3993c8569599affe/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-52869.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/velesnitski/yt-mcp/blob/52dfb763e45cbfe7e9957fbb53e0cf86e504c874/docs/adr/030-bump-mcp-sdk-cve-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/3a636e9ca4dec610ea52bddffa3cd59a180b7252/pypi/mcp/CVE-2026-52869.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a257431e220101b25f51c7e22239ee65d73c4dbf/2026/52xxx/CVE-2026-52869.json","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/8a18f344792f20d1c2a7515315a80b5fa6191d7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_3_CVE-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/2e88aa481ab4f16d3555ecf032c6cd4a38f5e2ff/content/posts/cve-2026-52869.md","https://github.com/SolaceLabs/solace-agent-mesh/blob/f76d8972fecac522055e8195b704ec631c698c99/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0393.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0408","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53518","title":"better-auth OAuth提供程序授权码并发兑换漏洞","description":"Better Auth 的 OAuth 授权码兑换端点 `POST /oauth2/token` 在处理 `authorization_code` 授权类型时，使用非原子的\"查找后删除\"原语来兑换单次使用的授权码。当两个并发请求携带相同的授权码同时到达时，两个请求都会在任一删除操作完成前通过读取步骤，随后均通过 PKCE 验证并调用 `createUserTokens`，从而为同一授权码生成多组独立的访问令牌、刷新令牌和 ID 令牌，违反了 RFC 6749 §4.1.2 关于授权码必须单次使用的规定。该漏洞影响使用 `@better-auth/oauth-provider` 版本 >=1.6.0 且 <1.6.11 的项目，以及使用 `better-auth` >=1.4.8-beta.7 且 <1.6.0 并启用了 oidc-provider 或 mcp 插件的项目，攻击者可通过并发发送携带相同授权码的令牌请求，绕过授权码一次性使用的安全限制，获取额外的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53518","GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:48.240","updated":"2026-07-21T16:03:12.347","remediation":"立即升级 @better-auth/oauth-provider 至 1.6.11 或更高版本；若使用 better-auth 的 oidc-provider/mcp 插件，需将 better-auth 升级至 1.6.11。临时缓解：在反向代理层对 code 参数做幂等缓存，或在数据库层面为 oauthAccessToken 表添加唯一约束禁止同一授权码重复兑换。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/b4bc65a007784b2eb0efb459e5fa6fd8055d3ec9","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d056d8ae56f5d770f04fc59fa77c6fef447db4a1/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53518.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/better-auth/CVE-2026-53518.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1210010a96b67ffb3c2e3cf21ffe55bbcd54dec5/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53518.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53518.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2026-53518.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/598c13a431feec2a954868f732e58a4be64c82c5/content/posts/cve-2026-53518.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/30dd168aecea0b6440311fa6d26d017e87a683f6/posts/cve-2026-53518-npm-better-auth-oauth-provider.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/20783e837c8d3900447582f2695481bf39f8f7ff/data/2026/CVE-2026-53518.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/82c2e2276363b4ef8fca1f40cb47533ebb3183e6/proposals/ghsa/GHSA-7w99-5wm4-3g79.proposal.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0408.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0407","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53517","title":"Better Auth oauth-provider OAuth 刷新令牌并发竞争漏洞","description":"Better Auth 的 OAuth 刷新令牌轮换机制存在并发竞争条件漏洞。`POST /oauth2/token` 端点在处理 `refresh_token` 授权时，对 `oauthRefreshToken` 行执行非原子的读取、验证、撤销和签发操作，两个并发请求携带同一父刷新令牌时，均可在对方完成撤销前通过检查，各自签发新的刷新令牌，导致令牌族分支。该漏洞影响使用 `@better-auth/oauth-provider` 版本 `>=1.6.0, <1.6.11` 或嵌入式 `better-auth` 插件版本 `>=1.4.8-beta.7, <1.6.0` 的项目，且至少有一个 OAuth 客户端请求了 `offline_access` 作用域。攻击者获取一个刷新令牌后，可通过并发重放请求创建无限延续的令牌分支，绕过撤销检测，获得持久化访问权限。CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。修复版本为 `@better-auth/oauth-provider@1.6.11`，该版本在轮换原语中对父行执行原子比较并交换操作，确保竞争条件下只有一个调用方成功签发新令牌，另一个收到 `invalid_grant` 错误。临时缓解措施包括：将数据库适配器设置为可序列化隔离级别、缩短刷新令牌有效期至 60 秒、在客户端使用互斥锁串行化刷新令牌使用，或不请求 `offline_access` 作用域以禁用刷新令牌。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53517","GHSA-392p-2q2v-4372"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:48.107","updated":"2026-07-21T16:00:22.173","remediation":"立即升级 @better-auth/oauth-provider 至 1.6.11 或更高版本，以及 better-auth 至 1.6.0 或更高版本。如使用内存适配器，需同步升级 @better-auth/memory-adapter 至 1.6.11 以确保原子比较交换（CAS）谓词正确处理 undefined 与 null 的语义。若无法立即升级，可在数据库上手动执行 CREATE UNIQUE INDEX oauth_refresh_token_token_uniq ON \"oauthRefreshToken\" (token) 作为纵深防御措施，或通过防火墙层限制 /oauth2/token 端点的并发请求频率，或将 refreshTokenExpiresIn 缩短至 60 秒以限制 forked token family 的存活时间，但上述缓解措施均无法完全修复竞态条件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/c6918ecc9e3a75892169415d7f6c95b591b6a52d","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-392p-2q2v-4372","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9109d68a178976362705ce50907751bdcde442d8/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53517.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/better-auth/CVE-2026-53517.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-53517/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/68f21110bba906c0c362bd693dd5c92b3006f044/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53517.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53517.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23da1b1d57c38f76917ec73d9286e2d57e423420/content/posts/cve-2026-53517.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/52f3a2c838641b6426a9831c5d786836995a1ac6/cve/CVE-2026-53517.html","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f55e6317cf39bbe423517d172b0edcb8b78ff702/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-53517-better-auth-oauth-refresh-token-rotation-forks-the-token-family-on-concurrent-redemption.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f1681edc3f70c2637ccb21590e6662de194aa5b/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-392p-2q2v-4372/GHSA-392p-2q2v-4372.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c4ba9b961b129b77c10e28189b9922bd2854ac1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53517.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0407.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0407.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0406","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53516","title":"Better Auth better-auth OAuth自动链接未验证预注册邮箱账户接管漏洞","description":"Better Auth 是一个用于 TypeScript 应用的认证授权库。在 1.6.11 版本之前，该库的 OAuth 回调自动链接机制存在逻辑缺陷：当 OAuth 提供者返回 email_verified: true 时，系统会直接将 OAuth 身份与本地账户隐式关联，而无需验证本地用户行的 emailVerified 字段。攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过 /sign-up/email 接口预先注册受害者的邮箱地址（此时本地账户的 emailVerified 为 false），随后当受害者通过支持 OAuth/SSO 的方式登录时，其 OAuth 身份会被自动绑定到攻击者已创建的账户上，导致账户被劫持。该漏洞影响所有使用 better-auth 版本低于 1.6.11 且启用了 emailAndPassword 和 OAuth/SSO 提供者的应用，并且可绕过 requireEmailVerification: true 的保护机制。修复方案为升级至 better-auth@1.6.11 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53516","GHSA-g38m-r43w-p2q7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:47.967","updated":"2026-07-21T14:14:22.307","remediation":"1. 立即将 better-auth 升级至 1.6.11 或更高版本，该版本在 OAuth 自动关联逻辑中增加了本地账户 emailVerified 状态校验，阻断攻击者利用未验证预注册邮箱进行账号绑定的路径。2. 若短期内无法升级，应在 betterAuth() 配置中将 account.accountLinking.disableImplicitLinking 设为 true，强制所有社交账号关联走已认证会话的 /link-social 端点，防止攻击者利用 OAuth 回调自动绑定受害者邮箱。3. 如业务场景不允许任何自动关联，可将 account.accountLinking.enabled 设为 false 彻底关闭账户关联功能。注意：仅开启 emailAndPassword.requireEmailVerification: true 不足以缓解此漏洞，因为关联过程中 OAuth 提供商的 email_verified 声明会触发本地行的 emailVerified 翻转，使攻击者的密码登录在关联后变为可用状态。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/da7e50beee849c59a2ed1ec6b3a38cc6ab9fb563","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/pull/9578","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-g38m-r43w-p2q7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cee83846410898acfe082d5ef5a9cde6a9d8b33c/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53516.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/better-auth/CVE-2026-53516.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-53516/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/68f21110bba906c0c362bd693dd5c92b3006f044/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53516.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53516.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23da1b1d57c38f76917ec73d9286e2d57e423420/content/posts/cve-2026-53516.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0e0743d8ea42860b402d47771117c8920a246907/posts/cve-2026-53516-npm-better-auth.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f1681edc3f70c2637ccb21590e6662de194aa5b/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-g38m-r43w-p2q7/GHSA-g38m-r43w-p2q7.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/f55e6317cf39bbe423517d172b0edcb8b78ff702/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-53516-better-auth-has-an-account-takeover-issue-via-oauth-auto-link-to-unverified-pre-registered-email.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/26bf82f4a19fc2d731fb6ea3f027707d0e70bd44/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53516.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0406.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0405","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53515","title":"Better Auth SSO 权限绕过漏洞","description":"Better Auth 的 @better-auth/sso 插件存在授权绕过漏洞，POST /sso/register 端点在注册 SSO 提供者时仅检查调用者是否具有组织成员身份，但未验证其是否具备管理员或所有者角色。攻击者利用此漏洞可在未获管理员授权的情况下，将恶意 OIDC 或 SAML 身份提供者绑定到其所属组织，随后通过 /sso/callback/{providerId} 回调将 IdP 断言的用户自动添加至目标组织，默认角色为成员。若组织配置了 organizationProvisioning.defaultRole 为 admin，攻击者还可创建具有管理员权限的用户。该漏洞影响 @better-auth/sso 版本 1.2.10 至 1.6.10（含），已在 1.6.11 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53515","GHSA-gv74-j8m3-fg5f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-15T18:16:47.817","updated":"2026-07-21T15:38:36.120","remediation":"立刻升级 @better-auth/sso 至 1.6.11 或更高版本，该版本在 registerSSOProvider 中补充了对调用者管理员或所有者角色的校验逻辑。若暂无法立即升级，可临时将 sso 插件配置中的 providersLimit 设为 0 以禁止新增 SSO 提供者，同时通过 organizationProvisioning.defaultRole 配置限制自动用户配置默认角色为最低权限，确保仅可信管理员可开通 SSO 登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/commit/86765f1597378f5c3deed1b80ca91faac0a6bf00","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/pull/9220","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/releases/tag/v1.6.11","https://github.com/better-auth/better-auth/security/advisories/GHSA-gv74-j8m3-fg5f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/98f5df8bf40c6af0934fb1e8baa83eb4ebb7d422/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53515.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/npm/@better-auth/sso/CVE-2026-53515.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/8daa528b86cceba659bc23c9d117879606b73f52/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53515/README.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a329726883dfdb4a537e92de8e7c65b70a4e67f/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53515.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/f352693f226c45464267beeea27f2ecfa0372f11/reports/2026-07-15/TIER_2_CVE-2026-53515.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/7e9e428b94c1aa1dd50a8c0c1d97365d260fbed6/content/posts/cve-2026-53515.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2026-53515.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9f14dd7a1c5691895422a824762c1dbc0caf1d9a/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53515.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/aa4de6b62e8c78e9e96e0c15cf0f9adf282b555c/CVEs_log/2026-07-16_en.md","https://github.com/ericverret35/opsintel/blob/3653241184ad94d2fc381a481248c2a4abae46e1/advisories/2026-07-20-ghsa-gv74-j8m3-fg5f.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0405.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0405.toml"}]